<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13964] Query cancellation freezes on local lazy queries</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13964</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The reason is a query cancellation that acquires an iterator&apos;s lock to&#160;check the availability of a next row and thus update a state of the cursor&#160;to prevent unnecessary request cancelation. But the lock is already held by a query thread to fetch a next page, so the cancellation is forced to wait till the page will be completely prefetched.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
